Disposable x64 Debug 8 GiB Hyper-V fixture, after fat-mirror-probe.patch.
Observe the FAT32 dirty map and the result of the real pin lookup; copy a
sector only while the caller has already pinned that page. Record classpnp
packet completions overlapping either FAT. The test installer
opens the target volume, flushes it immediately after copying PALAI.TTF, and
reads both sectors via a read-only whole-disk handle. It then allocates a
128 MiB named file, locates a complete FAT sector in a different cache view,
and measures a second flush with the same read-only disk handle. Its two
report files are created after the measured reads. No fault injection.
These observer and installer changes are only for the independent test ISO.

